{"accountName": "奇安信CERT", "author": "奇安信CERT", "body": null, "content": [{"text": "奇安信 CERT 2026-10-27 15:31 北京", "type": "p"}, {"text": "致力于第一时间为企业级用户提供权威漏洞情报和有效解决方案。", "type": "p"}, {"_imgCount": 1, "caption": "", "src": "https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/mmbiz_jpg/RwAbCjh555vegibZOLyIdmibpP4jLbLDDNEy3hNhYzYaclcV3iasst0rSCXAz6KjnibZz8iaR6hKyFROibZkbEKZGmPxgsJy7Cp4sUNkUs6klL5M0/0?wx_fmt=jpeg", "type": "img"}, {"text": "漏洞概述", "type": "p"}, {"text": "漏洞名称", "type": "p"}, {"text": "Linux Kernel POSIX CPU timer 释放后重用漏洞", "type": "p"}, {"_imgCount": true, "caption": "", "src": "https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/sz_mmbiz_png/RwAbCjh555sib80OWrAKlCY2Hn9o9RlMXoRtvh2X9AScg9GOywDAgeS20TmJO0XKQiaXyW8sg4p2HGibSicKcIF6mxWXLAZibnCtz7pRicGHzNonY/640?wx_fmt=png&from=appmsg", "type": "img"}, {"text": "漏洞编号", "type": "p"}, {"text": "QVD-2026-77402 ， CVE-2026-98260", "type": "p"}, {"text": "公开时间", "type": "p"}, {"_imgCount": true, "caption": "图片", "src": "https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/sz_mmbiz_jpg/RwAbCjh555sfDUlSIbqt52oqPUonrUBRd8TBs2zPYrWbQUI5A6S9ianbVNKYcW2GNuMhdNqp4WM8G9CkD508lwvibalaFibhcMw2dTKvJicrPgU/640?wx_fmt=jpeg&from=appmsg&watermark=1&wxfrom=5&wx_lazy=1&tp=webp#imgIndex=2", "type": "img"}, {"text": "2026-10-06", "type": "p"}, {"text": "影响量级", "type": "p"}, {"text": "百万级", "type": "p"}, {"text": "奇安信评级", "type": "p"}, {"text": "高危", "type": "p"}, {"text": "CVSS 3.1分数", "type": "p"}, {"text": "7.8", "type": "p"}, {"text": "威胁类型", "type": "p"}, {"text": "权限提升", "type": "p"}, {"text": "利用可能性", "type": "p"}, {"text": "POC状态", "type": "p"}, {"text": "已公开", "type": "p"}, {"text": "在野利用状态", "type": "p"}, {"text": "未发现", "type": "p"}, {"text": "EXP状态", "type": "p"}, {"text": "已公开", "type": "p"}, {"text": "技术细节状态", "type": "p"}, {"text": "已公开", "type": "p"}, {"text": "危害描述： 攻击者可利用该漏洞触发内核内存破坏，导致系统崩溃（拒绝服务）或实现本地权限提升至 root，甚至容器逃逸。", "type": "p"}, {"text": "0 1", "type": "p"}, {"text": "漏洞详情", "type": "p"}, {"text": "> > > >", "type": "p"}, {"text": "影响组件", "type": "p"}, {"text": "Linux 内核是一款开源的类 Unix 操作系统内核，是绝大多数 Linux 发行版的底层核心基础组件。内核负责管理系统硬件资源，实现进程调度、内存管理、文件系统、信号与定时器、设备驱动等核心基础能力。它为上层用户态程序提供系统调用接口，支撑应用程序运行，广泛部署在服务器、云容器、嵌入式设备以及 Android 移动终端当中。POSIX 定时器是内核提供给应用层的标准定时器接口，支持按线程 CPU 时间触发定时事件，供多线程业务程序使用。", "type": "p"}, {"text": "> > > >", "type": "p"}, {"text": "漏洞描述", "type": "p"}, {"text": "> > > >", "type": "p"}, {"text": "利用条件", "type": "p"}, {"text": "1.运行受影响 Linux 内核，且代码路径已编译进内核；该路径属于核心 exec/POSIX timer 设施，不能通过禁用模块移除。", "type": "p"}, {"text": "2.攻击者能在目标系统上执行本地代码，至少拥有普通用户 /ADB shell/ 容器内进程等低权限上下文。", "type": "p"}, {"text": "02", "type": "p"}, {"text": "影响范围", "type": "p"}, {"text": "> > > >", "type": "p"}, {"text": "影响版本", "type": "p"}, {"text": "Linux 内核 5.7 及之后版本（直至修复版本之前）；修复版本包括 6.6.158、6.12.112、6.18.54、7.2.8 及更高稳定分支（如 7.3-rc4）。", "type": "p"}, {"text": "受影响 git 提交范围自 55e8c8eb2c7b6bf30e99423ccfe7ca032f498f59 起，至对应修复提交（如 acb03d3881818581052924a9bbbe92b8741ed448 等）之前。", "type": "p"}, {"text": "5.7 <= Linux Kernel < 6.6.158", "type": "p"}, {"text": "Linux Kernel 6.12.* < 6.12.112", "type": "p"}, {"text": "Linux Kernel 6.18.* < 6.18.54", "type": "p"}, {"text": "Linux Kernel 7.2.* < 7.2.8", "type": "p"}, {"text": "Linux Kernel 7.3.* < 7.3-rc4", "type": "p"}, {"text": "> > > >", "type": "p"}, {"text": "其他受影响组件", "type": "p"}, {"text": "03", "type": "p"}, {"text": "复现情况", "type": "p"}, {"text": "目前， 奇安信CERT已成功复现 Linux Kernel POSIX CPU timer 释放后重用漏洞(CVE-2026-98260) ，截图如下：", "type": "p"}, {"text": "04", "type": "p"}, {"text": "处置建议", "type": "p"}, {"text": "> > > >", "type": "p"}, {"text": "安全更新", "type": "p"}, {"text": "Linux Kernel >= 6.6.158", "type": "p"}, {"text": "Linux Kernel 6.12.* >= 6.12.112", "type": "p"}, {"text": "Linux Kernel 6.18.* >= 6.18.54", "type": "p"}, {"text": "Linux Kernel 7.2.* >= 7.2.8", "type": "p"}, {"text": "Linux Kernel 7.3.* >= 7.3-rc4", "type": "p"}, {"text": "修复核心：将 POSIX 定时器清理（posix_cpu_timers_exit）移至 de_thread() 之后立即执行（相关提交包括 acb03d388181 等）。", "type": "p"}, {"text": "各发行版请应用官方安全更新并重启系统使新内核生效。Android 设备请关注厂商安全补丁。", "type": "p"}, {"text": "补丁下载地址：", "type": "p"}, {"text": "https://git.kernel.org/stable/c/acb03d3881818581052924a9bbbe92b8741ed448", "type": "p"}, {"text": "05", "type": "p"}, {"text": "[1] https://git.kernel.org/stable/c/6f1977cea3e85cd8ab55fb337d3e1725fe61d1ce", "type": "p"}, {"text": "[2] https://github.com/ylh440104/InfinityCore-Android-CVE-2026-98260", "type": "p"}, {"text": "06", "type": "p"}, {"text": "时间线", "type": "p"}, {"text": "2026年10月27日，奇安信 CERT发布安全风险通告。", "type": "p"}, {"text": "07", "type": "p"}, {"text": "漏洞情报服务", "type": "p"}, {"text": "「 奇安信漏洞情报平台 」 重磅上线，诚邀您来体验：", "type": "p"}, {"text": "奇安信 CERT", "type": "p"}, {"text": "致力于 第一时间为企业级用户提供 权威 漏洞情报和 有效 解决方案。", "type": "p"}, {"text": "点击↓ 阅读原文 ，到 ALPHA威胁分析平台 订阅更多漏洞信息。", "type": "p"}, {"text": "跳转微信打开", "type": "p"}], "cover": "https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/mmbiz_jpg/RwAbCjh555vegibZOLyIdmibpP4jLbLDDNEy3hNhYzYaclcV3iasst0rSCXAz6KjnibZz8iaR6hKyFROibZkbEKZGmPxgsJy7Cp4sUNkUs6klL5M0/0?wx_fmt=jpeg", "date": "10月27日", "id": "1240447537", "summary": "奇安信 CERT 2026-10-27 15:31 北京 \n致力于第一时间为企业级用户提供权威漏洞情报和有效解决方案。\n●  点击↑蓝字关注我们，获取更多安全风险通告 \n漏洞概述 \n漏洞名称 \nLinux Kernel POSIX CPU timer 释放后重用漏洞 \n漏洞编号 \nQVD-2026-77402 ， CVE-2026-98260 \n公开时间 \n2026-10-06 \n影响量级 \n百万", "title": "【已复现】Linux Kernel POSIX CPU timer 释放后重用漏洞(CVE-2026-98260)安全风险通告", "ts": 1793086260000, "url": "https://mp.weixin.qq.com/s?__biz=MzU5NDgxODU1MQ==&mid=2247507953&idx=1&sn=63d387c07e7193fafec342f7cbbe8b80"}